          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s868",
            "repere": "Texte · The Search Stops Here For An Intraworkou",
            "text": "The Search Stops Here For An Intraworkout Blend",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s870",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The supplement market is an overwhelming",
            "text": "The supplement market is an overwhelming landscape to navigate - mostly full of junk. For more than a decade &amp; a half, I've tried more than 15 different intraworkout products: Spartan Fuel finally delivers what I need without any jitters, crashes, or negative side effects.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s871",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The most recent experience I had with Sp",
            "text": "The most recent experience I had with Spartan Fuel paints a good picture of the superior product quality. When I used for a lower resistance training session, I could tell my body was getting more of the fuel it needed to support some of the final sets of compound exercises like hack squats &amp; squat presses - particularly at the end of my session. Anyone focused on hypertrophy will know that delivering those essential amino acids late in a workout can be tough, but pays invaluable dividends for both muscle growth &amp; post-workout recovery. Spartan Fuel did precisely this unlike many others.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s872",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · An additional factor I take seriously in",
            "text": "An additional factor I take seriously in an intraworkout product: hydration capability. As I get older, I've started to truly understand the importance of hydration for performing &amp; injury-proofing. When I'm not properly hydrated, I often feel fatigued &amp; crash at the tail end of longer sessions. The electrolytes blend kept me dialed in with proper nervous system support &amp; energized for a 75-min leg session without the experience of any crash I've experienced in the past around 45 min mark.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s873",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · As far as the flavor, the balanced natur",
            "text": "As far as the flavor, the balanced natural sweetness of Spartan Fuel pineapple is not overpowering &amp; exactly what many other intraworkout products I've tried in the past had been missing. It possesses a subtle tartness &amp; delivers an authentic tropical taste.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s874",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Spartan Fuel not only checks the boxes o",
            "text": "Spartan Fuel not only checks the boxes of a good intraworkout product - it dominates the market! A no brainer I'll be coming back!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
